>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MAIN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY COMMON.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    DISPLAY "MAIN: STARTING MODERNIZATION TEST".
    MOVE 3 TO WS-COUNT.
    COMPUTE WS-RESULT = WS-COUNT * 42.
    DISPLAY "MAIN: COUNT=" WS-COUNT.
    DISPLAY "MAIN: RESULT=" WS-RESULT.
    CALL "REPORT".
    DISPLAY "MAIN: ALL DONE".
    STOP RUN.
